<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="content stack">
    <span class="eyebrow">Inspirations</span>
    <h1 class="display">The oldest <em>call to prayer</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Before clocks and telephones, the church bell kept the hours and called the faithful to worship. Across America many towers have fallen silent. The foundation exists to help them ring again.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--story">
    <div class="stack prose">
      <p class="m0">For centuries the church bell has been the Christian call to prayer. A swinging bell gathers the congregation for Sunday worship; the Angelus is tolled at morning, noon, and evening; bells peal for weddings and toll in remembrance. A ringing bell tells a town, every day, that the church is alive and open.</p>
      <p class="m0">This is a serious undertaking, not a pastime. The DingDong Foundation, Inc. was certified by the IRS on July 28, 2026 as a 501(c)(3) private foundation. It supports the work of ringing: bells and their towers, pipe organs, rose windows and stained glass, and the training of the artisans who keep them.</p>
      <p class="m0">There is more in a bell than announcement. Cast bronze rings at frequencies long associated with healing, a sound that brings calm to a street, a room, and the people in them. The foundation's filed purpose includes grants to those who work with sound, color, and frequency for healing, and it honors that purpose.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="figure">
      <div class="figure__frame">
        <img src="{{ '/uploads/ringing-chamber.jpg' | url }}" alt="Bell ropes with striped sallies hanging in a ring inside a stone ringing chamber, a narrow arched window beyond and the bell wheels showing above the wooden ceiling" width="1600" height="2000" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <figcaption><span class="figure__caption">The room under the bells.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--band">
